## Read this first: two things you are not free to redistribute

**1. Texas Instruments Code Generation Tools.**
`sense/firmware/kitsune-4513/toolchain/cgt-5.1.5.tar.gz` is 55 MB of TI's
proprietary C compiler for the CC3200, redistributed here under no grant that
the author of this repository is able to give. It is present because
reproducing Hello's exact firmware binary requires that exact compiler version,
which TI no longer publishes. **TI is an active company with a live licence
agreement covering these tools**, which makes this the sharpest edge in the
