statement in any README, across every repository checked. Under default
copyright that means all rights reserved. Their being public on GitHub is not a
grant of rights. Hello ceased trading in 2017 and its assets were acquired, so
an owner exists.

The following are Hello's, reproduced here because the system does not function
without them:

| Path | What it is |
|---|---|
| `infrastructure/orb-algo/models/featureextractionlayer.bin` | byte-identical to Hello's own test fixture in `suripu-core` |
| `infrastructure/orb-algo/models/normal4.base64`, `normal4ensemble.base64` | Hello's trained sleep-model weights |
| `infrastructure/orb-algo/patches/` | patches against Hello's source; each contains their code as context |
